<title>GERMANY: GERMANY-UNIONS-WAGES.</title>
<headline>GERMANY-UNIONS-WAGES.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klaus Zwickel, head of the IG Metall trade union for the German metal and electronics sector, said on Tuesday its board would make its wage demands for 1997 known later on in the day.</p>
<p>&quot;We will be making a concrete recommendation,&quot; Zwickel said, before a meeting of the IG Metall board in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>A statement is due at 1400 local time (1200 GMT).</p>
</text>
